#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
vietsubminecratf - MOT FILE DUY NHAT

1) Chay trang web (cong 3000):
       python vietsubminecratf.py
   Mo http://127.0.0.1:3000 (hoac dia chi LAN in ra tren man hinh).
   Doi cong:  python vietsubminecratf.py --port 8080
   Cong khai ra Internet (nen dung HTTPS):
       python vietsubminecratf.py --host 127.0.0.1 --force-https --contact ban@tenmien.com   (dat sau Cloudflare Tunnel / Caddy / nginx)
       python vietsubminecratf.py --cert fullchain.pem --cert-key privkey.pem --contact ban@tenmien.com   (tu chay HTTPS)
   --contact: email hien tren trang Lien he / Go noi dung / Bao loi dich (hoac dat bien VSMC_CONTACT)
   Dat mat khau may chu (nguoi dung tu xa moi dung duoc xuat MP4/nghe video/AI):
       python vietsubminecratf.py matkhau            (hoi mat khau, luu vao ~/.vsmc_key)
       python vietsubminecratf.py matkhau --xoa      (xoa)    |   --xem (xem da dat chua)
   Hoac chay tam thoi: python vietsubminecratf.py --key "matkhau1" --key "matkhau2"   (nhieu mat khau, dung mot trong cac mat khau la duoc)
   Neu khong dat gi: moi lan chay se tu tao 1 mat khau ngau nhien va in ra man hinh (chi dung cho lan chay do).
   Luu nhieu mat khau: python vietsubminecratf.py matkhau --dat "matkhau1" --dat "matkhau2"

   Nghe video de tao phu de (Whisper, can: pip install faster-whisper):
       python vietsubminecratf.py stt --video video.mp4 --lang en --out phude.srt

2) Tao file long tieng bang giong mau (.wav hoac mp4, nhan ban giong, Vira-TTS):
       python vietsubminecratf.py tts --srt phude_vi.srt --ref giong-mau.wav --out long-tieng.wav
   Roi nap long-tieng.wav vao muc "4. Long tieng" tren trang.

   Nghe video VA DICH TU DONG sang tieng Viet (MyMemory mien phi, hoac Claude neu co --key):
       python vietsubminecratf.py stt --video video.mp4 --translate --out goc.srt --vi-out phude_vi.srt
       python vietsubminecratf.py stt --video video.mp4 --translate --engine claude --key sk-ant-... 
   NHANH (video 60 phut nghe + dich trong ~2 phut, chay duoc ca tren dien thoai/Termux):
       export GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
       python vietsubminecratf.py nhanh --video video.mp4 --lang en --vi-out phude_vi.srt
   (nghe bang Whisper tren may chu Groq, cat video thanh doan 5 phut chay song song, dich bang Claude song song)

   Chi dich file phu de co san:
       python vietsubminecratf.py dich --srt goc.srt --out phude_vi.srt [--src en] [--engine claude --key sk-ant-...]

Doi gioi han file tai len (mac dinh 4096 MB/file, 12288 MB tong):
       VSMC_MAX_UPLOAD_MB=8192 VSMC_MAX_WORK_MB=20480 python vietsubminecratf.py
   Luu y: Cloudflare (goi Free/Pro) tu chan moi yeu cau tren 100 MB truoc khi toi may chu.

Chi nhan ban giong cua chinh ban hoac giong nguoi da dong y cho ban dung.
"""
